sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant S as Server
    
    Note over C, S: TLS 1.3 over TCP (2-RTT)
    
    C->>S: TCP SYN
    S->>C: TCP SYN-ACK
    C->>S: TCP ACK
    Note right of S: 1-RTT (Transport Ready)
    
    C->>S: TLS ClientHello
    S->>C: TLS ServerHello, Certificate, Finished
    C->>S: TLS Finished
    Note right of S: 2-RTT (Crypto Ready)
    
    C->>S: HTTP GET /
    S->>C: HTTP 200 OK (Data)
    
    
    Note over C, S: QUIC Initial Handshake (1-RTT)
    
    C->>S: QUIC ClientHello + Crypto Data
    S->>C: QUIC ServerHello + Transport Params + Crypto Data
    Note right of S: 1-RTT (Transport & Crypto Ready)
    
    C->>S: QUIC Finished + HTTP GET /
    S->>C: HTTP 200 OK (Data)
    
    
    Note over C, S: QUIC Session Resumption (0-RTT)
    
    C->>S: QUIC ClientHello + Cached Crypto Data + HTTP GET /
    Note right of C: Data sent in first flight!
    S->>C: HTTP 200 OK (Data)
